"⟪k:0⟫This being a church, no one is speaking especially loudly, but there’s still an indistinct "
"buzz hanging in the air as dozens of people whisper back and forth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Essendo una chiesa, tutti parlano con tono moderato,⟪k:1⟫ma c’è comunque un ronzio "
"indistinto nell’aria dovuto ai numerosi sussurri provenienti da ogni dove."

